<title>USA: Digital Biometrics product comletes review.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics product comletes review.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said the Nevada Gaming Control Board has completed its review of the company's Trak-21 player tracking system.</p>
<p>Using the system, a players insert a VIP card into a reader slot at any table position on a gambling table. The player is immediately recognized by the casino's computer database, time-in and time-out are automatically logged and players wages can be totaled.</p>
</text>
